WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,360
Children inside the family

2
00:00:01,360 --> 00:00:05,310
Please resolve to request a stir-fry box

3
00:00:05,310 --> 00:00:06,870
Peony fourteen inches nine hundred and eighty-eight

4
00:00:12,740 --> 00:00:13,860
Say hello to Hua Qian San

5
00:00:13,860 --> 00:00:15,060
You are worth one thousand four hundred and fifty

6
00:00:15,970 --> 00:00:17,530
Dad, what are your principles?

7
00:00:19,010 --> 00:00:20,170
The principle is only a few watches

8
00:00:20,170 --> 00:00:21,930
Let's go back and tell your mother

9
00:00:21,930 --> 00:00:26,690
Hua spent a thousand and seven and taught her a thousand. How can we divide the remaining one hundred and fifty between the two of us?

10
00:00:27,490 --> 00:00:29,420
you fifty

11
00:00:29,420 --> 00:00:30,340
Listen to what I say

12
00:00:31,120 --> 00:00:40,880
Because I am your father

13
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,030
Why don't we go home from the west and make such a big circle?

14
00:00:44,550 --> 00:00:45,470
Do you think your father is like that?

15
00:00:45,470 --> 00:00:47,310
People who buy a color shop will be stinky and white

16
00:00:47,310 --> 00:00:48,430
If it weren't for you, old man

17
00:00:48,430 --> 00:00:50,030
Ability to deliberately take detours to engage in intelligence operations

18
00:00:50,030 --> 00:00:55,400
Know the word "caidian" in your home

19
00:00:55,400 --> 00:00:56,840
Huzi is a filial child

20
00:00:56,840 --> 00:00:58,920
Didn’t I beat a black dutiful son yesterday?

21
00:00:58,920 --> 00:01:00,920
You must buy a TV for me and Wang Hui

22
00:01:00,920 --> 00:01:02,760
He said he was worried that the two of us would be bored at home.

23
00:01:02,760 --> 00:01:04,350
Hu Zikai, that boy from my family

24
00:01:04,350 --> 00:01:05,750
I can burn high incense with half the tiger seeds

25
00:01:05,750 --> 00:01:06,990
We only have two color shops on site.

26
00:01:06,990 --> 00:01:09,430
I bought my parents my first job with my own ability.

27
00:01:09,430 --> 00:01:11,750
They say your tiger is the most troublesome and has the best luck.

28
00:01:11,750 --> 00:01:12,750
Catch up with the black shrimps and dig out the bees

29
00:01:12,750 --> 00:01:14,070
This kid is cheap

30
00:01:14,070 --> 00:01:18,230
It’s because he has the filial piety to sell the black shrimps, and the little money he gets is wiped out by Aunt Wang, Aunt Niu, and Mrs. Bai.

31
00:01:18,230 --> 00:01:19,470
Come to my house and watch TV more often when you have time in the future

32
00:01:19,470 --> 00:01:22,270
I can't stop you from putting the money in your treasury when you go to the lottery shop.

33
00:01:22,270 --> 00:01:23,470
Count them one by one

34
00:01:23,470 --> 00:01:24,630
My distressed face turned green

35
00:01:24,630 --> 00:01:26,190
Now it’s time to show it off

36
00:01:26,190 --> 00:01:27,590
But ginger is still spicy when old

37
00:01:27,590 --> 00:01:28,550
Dressed for graduation

38
00:01:28,550 --> 00:01:29,950
He also gave up the idea of borrowing money from others.
